    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banzai Escape 2 Subterranean is a sequel game based on the events of Banzai Escape 2 where the Draugr labs have been captured by SPECTRE. All of the sisters (Inchester, Imingter and Iekler) take in refugees to a location deep underground. In order to survive, they must defeat the Lanun occupying the underground dungeon networks along with other factions such as SPECTRE and others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an Elite Imingter agent with special access to roaming around underground networks to dispose any incoming threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Lets Journey Underground Subterranean network<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/d044ffdfda5f802ed45973c78cbb1472.poster.avif?t=1751069632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/d044ffdfda5f802ed45973c78cbb1472.webm?t=1751069632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/d044ffdfda5f802ed45973c78cbb1472.mp4?t=1751069632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Engaging Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/c7f67791bf6f5a82780da91be638fcaf.poster.avif?t=1751069632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/c7f67791bf6f5a82780da91be638fcaf.webm?t=1751069632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/c7f67791bf6f5a82780da91be638fcaf.mp4?t=1751069632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Completing Missions<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/abc796107af2824fd1f241af7e6d6f3d.poster.avif?t=1751069632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/abc796107af2824fd1f241af7e6d6f3d.webm?t=1751069632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/abc796107af2824fd1f241af7e6d6f3d.mp4?t=1751069632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1P or 2P</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/a926a683349cd877b4a84df3cbd5aa8b.avif?t=1751069632\" /></div>Single-player / Co-op mode to allow friend to play together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fun! Chaotic! Intense!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/91ba316f7f61dfc0cc02702b9d2ab1f9.avif?t=1751069632\" /></div>Player will always be encountering action moment with rogue and aggressive like of enemies while finishing your objectives</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/1cf5b380105d3822859aaf40f7f974d9.avif?t=1751069632\" /></div>Customizable costumes / skins. Lots varieties of options to choose to make your character looks prettier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Random Generated Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/6d12fdff4275f78508c45b0b8e21cc83.avif?t=1751069632\" /></div>Random generate map segments to allow different path taken toward objectives area inside underground dungeon</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RNG Arsenals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/08d447d644e601487898f71bde2c3a04.avif?t=1751069632\" /></div>Random generate gun &amp; powerups or loot-able for grinding. Lots of guns and about 56++ nano-plugin addon powerups skills with lots of random stats that can be obtainable. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">..And Many more!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random 15 / 20 level difficulty (5 easy, 5 Medium, 5 Hard, etc)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random Mission / Objectives based system (Destroy, Capture, Kill, etc)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/65933dec28846ab26790adce8331fc2a.avif?t=1751069632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord : Facebook </p>",
